record legeos.papercut.cargo-run-q-p-xtask-check-packaging-fails-on-a/1 : papercut {
    title "`cargo run -q -p xtask -- check-packaging` fails on a tree where `just…"
    state verified
    statement """
        `cargo run -q -p xtask -- check-packaging` fails on a tree where `just preview-codecs` has not been run (or where target/ has been cleaned), reporting three legeos-filed asset sources under target/preview-codecs as missing. The gate is checking a build output rather than a source fact, so a clean checkout fails a check that has nothing wrong with it; the message could say to run `just preview-codecs` first.
        """
