    state verified
    statement """
        Running `cargo clippy -p templar-shell` from Lubuntu failed linking pam-sys's build script: target/debug/build/clang-sys-*/output says rustc-link-lib=clang-21.1.8 from /usr/lib/llvm-21, which exists only on TemplarOS (the repo and target/ are shared across both OSes; Lubuntu has llvm-19/20). Workaround: CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/... ; fix might be per-OS target dirs.
        """
    observed_at git:2bc8f741f3c21759c3e7c728d9c211868035aa18
