        templar doctor freeze matched only the watchdog build's idle-blank wording ('outputs blanked'/'outputs woken'), so on every boot that actually froze (the b919ed4 build logs 'idle timeout reached'/'input after an idle blank') it reported no idle blank; IDLE_MARKERS now matches both.
        """
    observed_at git:50af3784cb5c3f0ebe72a1e15f12a88f57e11290
    author "claude"
