    state verified
    statement """
        The Home Field's own reflow/focus/ops tests are thorough, but nothing in the shell exercises a widget's declared regions through a real Ui with input — the field_screen harness always passes an empty widget map. So the session tile's rung assignment and its click routing had no coverage at all, and the inverted rung rule (Shut down at the floor, Log out hidden) was invisible to the suite. Teaching the harness to carry WidgetSnapshots would let every widget's controls be tested where they are actually drawn.
